(3451933, 479841, 53316, '<td valign="top">Personally I think I would have voted a couple points higher without the ladybug.  I don''t know why but it really distracts me. I think I just love the beautiful patterns created by the black and white.  I''m still not giving a horrible score though, because I do like the image overall.</td>', 'Personally I think I would have voted a couple points higher without the ladybug.  I don''t know why but it really distracts me. I think I just love the beautiful patterns created by the black and white.  I''m still not giving a horrible score though, because I do like the image overall.', '2007-03-12 02:22:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3451938, 481584, 53316, '<td valign="top">Levels or curves adjustment would probably give more impact.</td>', 'Levels or curves adjustment would probably give more impact.', '2007-03-12 02:24:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3451943, 481776, 53316, '<td valign="top">Oh gosh. This photo reminds me of John de Lancie''s character Q from Star Trek (various series..)  Very serious sometimes but a hidden smirk not far from the surface.  I like how you balanced the playfulness of dots with a serious expression - I think it works well.</td>', 'Oh gosh. This photo reminds me of John de Lancie''s character Q from Star Trek (various series..)  Very serious sometimes but a hidden smirk not far from the surface.  I like how you balanced the playfulness of dots with a serious expression - I think it works well.', '2007-03-12 02:27:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3451945, 481857, 53316, '<td valign="top">Nice to arrange the circular things with the grain at a different angle from the background grain. I think it makes an interesting composition.</td>', 'Nice to arrange the circular things with the grain at a different angle from the background grain. I think it makes an interesting composition.', '2007-03-12 02:28:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3451980, 481422, 53316, '<td valign="top">I''m trying not to be a dnmc nazi.. but I do not really feel that a circle shape is key, even though the objects are encircling. I see almost more of a triangle type shape formed by the objects. But I do think this is a great photo in its own right.</td>', 'I''m trying not to be a dnmc nazi.. but I do not really feel that a circle shape is key, even though the objects are encircling. I see almost more of a triangle type shape formed by the objects. But I do think this is a great photo in its own right.', '2007-03-12 02:48:44.000000', NULL, 1),
