(3452059, 481886, 16004, '<td valign="top">an elegantly stylish image; especially like the use of the desaturation which i find to be very effective.  has something very cover of a book thing about it - would probably be a fairly successful stock photo.  only slight reservation is that it feels a tad too tightly cropped, and might have in fact benefitted from a black frame.  and also not sure if it really says "circle" prominently enough.  Otherwise very likeable though.  <br/> <br/>My New Scoring System ; composition + technical 2/3, challenge 0.5/1, post processing results 2/2, ooooh factor 2.5/3, originality 0.5/1 = 7.5 (or 8)</td>', 'an elegantly stylish image; especially like the use of the desaturation which i find to be very effective.  has something very cover of a book thing about it - would probably be a fairly successful stock photo.  only slight reservation is that it feels a tad too tightly cropped, and might have in fact benefitted from a black frame.  and also not sure if it really says "circle" prominently enough.  Otherwise very likeable though.   My New Scoring System ; composition + technical 2/3, challenge 0.5/1, post processing results 2/2, ooooh factor 2.5/3, originality 0.5/1 = 7.5 (or 8)', '2007-03-12 03:34:40.000000', NULL, 1),
