(3452421, 482320, 16004, '<td valign="top">strangely excited about this shot.  very new bloc party album cover about it.  the lights, especially at the back of the roundabout, are a little bit too diffused / fluffy / undefined for my own personal liking (i find thin traces of car lights a bit more dynamic), but otherwise good stuff.  Great angle, and the elevated position of where the shot was taken is very effective.  really cool.<br/> <br/>A Weighted Scoring System ; composition + technical 1.5/3, challenge 1/1, post processing results 1/2, ooooh factor 2.5/3, originality 0.5/1 = 6.5 (rounded to 7)</td>', 'strangely excited about this shot.  very new bloc party album cover about it.  the lights, especially at the back of the roundabout, are a little bit too diffused / fluffy / undefined for my own personal liking (i find thin traces of car lights a bit more dynamic), but otherwise good stuff.  Great angle, and the elevated position of where the shot was taken is very effective.  really cool. A Weighted Scoring System ; composition + technical 1.5/3, challenge 1/1, post processing results 1/2, ooooh factor 2.5/3, originality 0.5/1 = 6.5 (rounded to 7)', '2007-03-12 08:21:09.000000', NULL, 1),
