(3453145, 482225, 45519, '<td valign="top">Ahh, the Slinky ... is there any photographic subject this can''t be used for? ;-)  I like the vivid color and composition, for the most part.  The only thing that bugs me is how the red end of the slinky appears to end abruptly.  In on sense it''s almost dynamic, as if the slinky were reaching out into the negative space; making it''s next move if you will.  However, I think it''d be more pleasing if that end terminated either in a perfect circle (versus the egg shape seen here) or carried on out of frame in the upper right corner.  Regardless of that nitpicking ... nicely done. :)</td>', 'Ahh, the Slinky ... is there any photographic subject this can''t be used for? ;-)  I like the vivid color and composition, for the most part.  The only thing that bugs me is how the red end of the slinky appears to end abruptly.  In on sense it''s almost dynamic, as if the slinky were reaching out into the negative space; making it''s next move if you will.  However, I think it''d be more pleasing if that end terminated either in a perfect circle (versus the egg shape seen here) or carried on out of frame in the upper right corner.  Regardless of that nitpicking ... nicely done. :)', '2007-03-12 12:01:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3453146, 481234, 45519, '<td valign="top">So he''s looking down the barrel of your lens?  Gotta think you''re gonna lose that standoff. ;-)  Nicely done.</td>', 'So he''s looking down the barrel of your lens?  Gotta think you''re gonna lose that standoff. ;-)  Nicely done.', '2007-03-12 12:02:16.000000', NULL, 1),
