(3453170, 481948, 45519, '<td valign="top">I see the circle as I wonder around the image, but they don''t stand out to me as the key element (as prescribed by the challenge description).  The subtlty works with the photo, just not sure it works as a main focal point.</td>', 'I see the circle as I wonder around the image, but they don''t stand out to me as the key element (as prescribed by the challenge description).  The subtlty works with the photo, just not sure it works as a main focal point.', '2007-03-12 12:09:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3453178, 482807, 45519, '<td valign="top">I really want to like this one, out of personal interest.  Unfortunately, while I like the light and almost silhouette feel of the steering wheel, the exposure isn''t quite there and it''s overly soft.  *5* for effort and meeting the challenge theme in your capture.</td>', 'I really want to like this one, out of personal interest.  Unfortunately, while I like the light and almost silhouette feel of the steering wheel, the exposure isn''t quite there and it''s overly soft.  *5* for effort and meeting the challenge theme in your capture.', '2007-03-12 12:10:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3453185, 482794, 45519, '<td valign="top">Ball bearing in the center of a CD/DVD?  Love the chrome with blue colors; reflection in chrome adds interest.</td>', 'Ball bearing in the center of a CD/DVD?  Love the chrome with blue colors; reflection in chrome adds interest.', '2007-03-12 12:13:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(3453197, 482594, 45519, '<td valign="top">I assume there was a reason to use selective color -- i.e., to isolate the subjects so they stood out.  However, as a result of that technique the ying and yang symbols appear almost photoshopped *into* the scen, with the subject in white having an almost hovering effect.  I like the concept and general composition ... but would like to see it in full color (or at least without the residual post processing effects).</td>', 'I assume there was a reason to use selective color -- i.e., to isolate the subjects so they stood out.  However, as a result of that technique the ying and yang symbols appear almost photoshopped *into* the scen, with the subject in white having an almost hovering effect.  I like the concept and general composition ... but would like to see it in full color (or at least without the residual post processing effects).', '2007-03-12 12:16:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3453214, 482715, 45519, '<td valign="top">Love the gritty textures and tone ... excellent composition as well.</td>', 'Love the gritty textures and tone ... excellent composition as well.', '2007-03-12 12:23:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3453224, 481969, 45519, '<td valign="top">I see the circles represented here, but it''s hard not to look immediately past them to the harbor in the distance ... making that the focal point and relegating the circlular elements to something much less than the primary subject.  Excellent photo regardless (beautiful light and nice composition).</td>', 'I see the circles represented here, but it''s hard not to look immediately past them to the harbor in the distance ... making that the focal point and relegating the circlular elements to something much less than the primary subject.  Excellent photo regardless (beautiful light and nice composition).', '2007-03-12 12:26:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3453226, 482368, 45519, '<td valign="top">Beautiful light and wonderfully captured.</td>', 'Beautiful light and wonderfully captured.', '2007-03-12 12:27:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3453283, 482730, 67152, '<td valign="top">i love the use of shallow DOF on this one.  Nice colors and lighting as well 7</td>', 'i love the use of shallow DOF on this one.  Nice colors and lighting as well 7', '2007-03-12 12:46:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3453288, 482153, 67152, '<td valign="top">This is just sweet!  Love the color and motion of the wheel.  The exposure is just about perfect (we can even see the illuminated area below the blue trees!)</td>', 'This is just sweet!  Love the color and motion of the wheel.  The exposure is just about perfect (we can even see the illuminated area below the blue trees!)', '2007-03-12 12:48:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(3453291, 482218, 67152, '<td valign="top">That is one unique view on the circle challenge- I see it (i think!).  The colors and perspective are very neat.</td>', 'That is one unique view on the circle challenge- I see it (i think!).  The colors and perspective are very neat.', '2007-03-12 12:49:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3453295, 482225, 63360, '<td valign="top">This is one of the best slinky shots I''ve ever seen.  Should do well here.  10</td>', 'This is one of the best slinky shots I''ve ever seen.  Should do well here.  10', '2007-03-12 12:50:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3453297, 481085, 67152, '<td valign="top">nice concept - but the image seems somewhat underexposed.</td>', 'nice concept - but the image seems somewhat underexposed.', '2007-03-12 12:50:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3453327, 482760, 71958, '<td valign="top">I love this idea.</td>', 'I love this idea.', '2007-03-12 13:02:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3453402, 482579, 173, '<td valign="top">Good idea, but the photo looks too much like a snap shoot. Would have been nice to see some better lighting, a different angle (perhaps a profile), and changing it to black and white would have been nice. Hopefully this helps for future shots.</td>', 'Good idea, but the photo looks too much like a snap shoot. Would have been nice to see some better lighting, a different angle (perhaps a profile), and changing it to black and white would have been nice. Hopefully this helps for future shots.', '2007-03-12 13:23:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3453420, 481584, 62787, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, lovely composition. My one objection would be that it could have been done on a different background - I like the fact that it''s a wooden floor, but the colour of it isn''t great, a more complementary colour would have made it a really fantastic shot. But that''s just imo.</td>', 'Nice idea, lovely composition. My one objection would be that it could have been done on a different background - I like the fact that it''s a wooden floor, but the colour of it isn''t great, a more complementary colour would have made it a really fantastic shot. But that''s just imo.', '2007-03-12 13:27:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(3453431, 482643, 62787, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, but I think a perfectly centred composition would have worked better in this case.</td>', 'Nice shot, but I think a perfectly centred composition would have worked better in this case.', '2007-03-12 13:29:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(3453435, 482379, 62787, '<td valign="top">I would''ve rotated it clockwise slightly - the downwards lines are a bit distracting.</td>', 'I would''ve rotated it clockwise slightly - the downwards lines are a bit distracting.', '2007-03-12 13:31:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3453449, 481847, 66223, '<td valign="top">i like the perspective.  i hope you didn''t cut yourself getting this shot...</td>', 'i like the perspective.  i hope you didn''t cut yourself getting this shot...', '2007-03-12 13:36:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3453454, 482526, 66223, '<td valign="top">hey, that almost looks like a mandelbrot!!!</td>', 'hey, that almost looks like a mandelbrot!!!', '2007-03-12 13:38:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3453462, 482698, 66223, '<td valign="top">great capture!  i''m impressed by the good balance of exposure between the torch and the rest of the image.  also, i hope this was with a telephoto lens :-)</td>', 'great capture!  i''m impressed by the good balance of exposure between the torch and the rest of the image.  also, i hope this was with a telephoto lens :-)', '2007-03-12 13:41:17.000000', NULL, 1),
