(3453547, 482531, 24454, '<td valign="top">Ohmy!!!!   It takes aLOT to really impress me with a flower photo, but this one takes my breath away!   It definitely goes down as one of my favorite flower photos of ALL TIME!  11. . .ooops. . .darn, I can only give it a 10!</td>', 'Ohmy!!!!   It takes aLOT to really impress me with a flower photo, but this one takes my breath away!   It definitely goes down as one of my favorite flower photos of ALL TIME!  11. . .ooops. . .darn, I can only give it a 10!', '2007-03-12 14:03:32.000000', NULL, 1),
