(3453571, 482731, 66384, '<td valign="top">There are a lot of nice circles. The harsh mid-day light seems to wash out some of the impact of this image. And the soft focus also reduces the impact. I''m being very picky, but I would also like the crop to be wider, so the hat on the right isn''t cut off.</td>', 'There are a lot of nice circles. The harsh mid-day light seems to wash out some of the impact of this image. And the soft focus also reduces the impact. I''m being very picky, but I would also like the crop to be wider, so the hat on the right isn''t cut off.', '2007-03-12 14:14:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3453580, 482806, 67728, '<td valign="top">Awesome swirls.  Love what you have accomplished.</td>', 'Awesome swirls.  Love what you have accomplished.', '2007-03-12 14:17:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3453589, 482779, 66384, '<td valign="top">I love this concept, and the target on the sunglasses is terrific. I understand that the archer has an arrow drawn back across his face, but the stark white of that line cuts the image and is confusing at first. I''d like to see what it would look like with a black arrow.</td>', 'I love this concept, and the target on the sunglasses is terrific. I understand that the archer has an arrow drawn back across his face, but the stark white of that line cuts the image and is confusing at first. I''d like to see what it would look like with a black arrow.', '2007-03-12 14:20:36.000000', NULL, 1),
