(3454102, 482637, 30982, '<td valign="top">I know this is DPC where simple and uncluttered rules, but I''d like to see this more in the context of where it is.  It''s a gorgeous pice and you''ve handled it in B&amp;W very well.</td>', 'I know this is DPC where simple and uncluttered rules, but I''d like to see this more in the context of where it is.  It''s a gorgeous pice and you''ve handled it in B&W very well.', '2007-03-12 16:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3454103, 482262, 16004, '<td valign="top">i like the creativeness of this, and how it so nicely fit the challenge.  very well spotted.  the way in which our eyes are guided through the nearest circles to the wheel in question is super.  other little aspects (the low POV, the great use of perspective, the roads largely free of traffic and pedestrians, the mix of cobbles and the grille) all come together to make a great city scene.  and the B&amp;W seems like a good choice as well.  nice one!<br/> <br/>my first weighted scoring system; composition + technical 2/3, challenge 1/1, post processing results 1.5/2, ooooh factor 2/3, originality 1/1 = 7.5 (rounded to 8)</td>', 'i like the creativeness of this, and how it so nicely fit the challenge.  very well spotted.  the way in which our eyes are guided through the nearest circles to the wheel in question is super.  other little aspects (the low POV, the great use of perspective, the roads largely free of traffic and pedestrians, the mix of cobbles and the grille) all come together to make a great city scene.  and the B&W seems like a good choice as well.  nice one! my first weighted scoring system; composition + technical 2/3, challenge 1/1, post processing results 1.5/2, ooooh factor 2/3, originality 1/1 = 7.5 (rounded to 8)', '2007-03-12 16:57:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3454105, 482508, 30982, '<td valign="top">Funny - I like it!  Lots to see and explore here (which I like, but DPC may not.)  Nice perspective!  I like how the mirror "world" is very different from that beyond it, and the sun reflected in the window, reflected in the mirror somehow completes the scene.</td>', 'Funny - I like it!  Lots to see and explore here (which I like, but DPC may not.)  Nice perspective!  I like how the mirror "world" is very different from that beyond it, and the sun reflected in the window, reflected in the mirror somehow completes the scene.', '2007-03-12 16:58:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3454107, 480112, 30982, '<td valign="top">Cool!  Do they have warning signs for unsuspecting canoeists, or do they simply disappear??  Lovely warm light.</td>', 'Cool!  Do they have warning signs for unsuspecting canoeists, or do they simply disappear??  Lovely warm light.', '2007-03-12 16:59:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3454111, 481826, 30982, '<td valign="top">Very nice work with the theme - color scheme is nice as well.</td>', 'Very nice work with the theme - color scheme is nice as well.', '2007-03-12 17:00:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3454112, 482779, 30982, '<td valign="top">Very well done - great idea, too.</td>', 'Very well done - great idea, too.', '2007-03-12 17:00:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3454120, 482262, 30982, '<td valign="top">I so hate to see that.  Rest of the bike is long gone.  I do like the shot, though.</td>', 'I so hate to see that.  Rest of the bike is long gone.  I do like the shot, though.', '2007-03-12 17:02:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(3454122, 481980, 16004, '<td valign="top">i love this very much.  it could, methinks, do with being made just a tad brighter, and possibly the weeist bit more saturation to bring out the nice variety of colours and boost that summery feel, but that aside it''s pretty much perfect.  the use of blur is fantastically executed, the moment of capture interesting, natural and involving, and is basically a great image.  it''s odd, the more i look the more melancholy one feels, which is good given the fun naure normally associated with such activities. super.<br/> <br/>my first weighted scoring system; composition + technical 3/3, challenge 1/1, post processing results 1.75/2, ooooh factor 3/3, originality 1/1 = 9.75 (okay, 10).</td>', 'i love this very much.  it could, methinks, do with being made just a tad brighter, and possibly the weeist bit more saturation to bring out the nice variety of colours and boost that summery feel, but that aside it''s pretty much perfect.  the use of blur is fantastically executed, the moment of capture interesting, natural and involving, and is basically a great image.  it''s odd, the more i look the more melancholy one feels, which is good given the fun naure normally associated with such activities. super. my first weighted scoring system; composition + technical 3/3, challenge 1/1, post processing results 1.75/2, ooooh factor 3/3, originality 1/1 = 9.75 (okay, 10).', '2007-03-12 17:03:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3454126, 482284, 73235, '<td valign="top">very interesting contrast in the circles</td>', 'very interesting contrast in the circles', '2007-03-12 17:04:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3454129, 482715, 73235, '<td valign="top">unbalancing composition. that''s what you intended? good job</td>', 'unbalancing composition. that''s what you intended? good job', '2007-03-12 17:06:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3454132, 480318, 30982, '<td valign="top">It meets the challenge, has several circles, and is one of my favorite subjects, but it''s a little lacking in context and has "weak technicals" in DPC parlance.  The light is kinda harsh (creating the dark shadows on the wall), the clutter behind the bike doesn''t seem to add to the picture, and the composition seems just a bit off to me, since you can''t see the rest of the bike.</td>', 'It meets the challenge, has several circles, and is one of my favorite subjects, but it''s a little lacking in context and has "weak technicals" in DPC parlance.  The light is kinda harsh (creating the dark shadows on the wall), the clutter behind the bike doesn''t seem to add to the picture, and the composition seems just a bit off to me, since you can''t see the rest of the bike.', '2007-03-12 17:06:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3454134, 481575, 16004, '<td valign="top">goodness! a bizarre and absorbing composition!  i like this quite a lot, and is quite rewarding.  seems slightly too chaotic to truly fit the challenge (to me anyway, any challenge with emphasis on a geometric shape kind of suggests strong clarity of lines).  but i do love it as art.  <br/> <br/>my first weighted scoring system; composition + technical 3/3, challenge 0.5/1, post processing results 1.5/2, ooooh factor 2.5/3, originality 1/1 = 8.5 (rounded to 9)</td>', 'goodness! a bizarre and absorbing composition!  i like this quite a lot, and is quite rewarding.  seems slightly too chaotic to truly fit the challenge (to me anyway, any challenge with emphasis on a geometric shape kind of suggests strong clarity of lines).  but i do love it as art.   my first weighted scoring system; composition + technical 3/3, challenge 0.5/1, post processing results 1.5/2, ooooh factor 2.5/3, originality 1/1 = 8.5 (rounded to 9)', '2007-03-12 17:07:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3454135, 482208, 200, '<td valign="top">hmmm..not a bad shot. Could have been edited better, but who am i to complain? Would be cool if all the dancing people were perfectly reflected in a colorful wavy pattern in his horn.</td>', 'hmmm..not a bad shot. Could have been edited better, but who am i to complain? Would be cool if all the dancing people were perfectly reflected in a colorful wavy pattern in his horn.', '2007-03-12 17:07:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3454139, 482688, 30982, '<td valign="top">How delightful!  It seems so terribly incongruous, though I''m not sure if that''s the word I''m looking for.  At any rate, I like it.</td>', 'How delightful!  It seems so terribly incongruous, though I''m not sure if that''s the word I''m looking for.  At any rate, I like it.', '2007-03-12 17:09:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3454143, 482470, 73235, '<td valign="top">the busy background is very distracting</td>', 'the busy background is very distracting', '2007-03-12 17:09:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3454144, 482643, 30982, '<td valign="top">Not yet!  Level, that is.</td>', 'Not yet!  Level, that is.', '2007-03-12 17:09:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3454178, 482153, 16004, '<td valign="top">expertly taken - i''ve stood in the same spot and never got remotely close to such a great picture from there.  you''ve done a real goodun of a job; the tree lights are joyful and sharp, and the red against the setting sky just looks divine.  great motion blur / long exposure without overdoing the light...  stunning image.<br/> <br/>my first weighted scoring system; composition + technical 3/3, challenge 1/1, post processing results 2/2, ooooh factor 3/3, originality 0.5/1 = 9.5 (upped to 10)</td>', 'expertly taken - i''ve stood in the same spot and never got remotely close to such a great picture from there.  you''ve done a real goodun of a job; the tree lights are joyful and sharp, and the red against the setting sky just looks divine.  great motion blur / long exposure without overdoing the light...  stunning image. my first weighted scoring system; composition + technical 3/3, challenge 1/1, post processing results 2/2, ooooh factor 3/3, originality 0.5/1 = 9.5 (upped to 10)', '2007-03-12 17:15:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(3454184, 482120, 30982, '<td valign="top">Both.  :-)  Kinda makes me dizzy to look at, though.</td>', 'Both.  :-)  Kinda makes me dizzy to look at, though.', '2007-03-12 17:17:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3454187, 482101, 30982, '<td valign="top">Priceless!</td>', 'Priceless!', '2007-03-12 17:17:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(3454189, 482140, 5354, '<td valign="top">Ever so slightly over exposed, maybe just half or one stop.</td>', 'Ever so slightly over exposed, maybe just half or one stop.', '2007-03-12 17:18:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3454190, 482269, 30982, '<td valign="top">Intriguing DOF - makes me wonder what the building I can see reflected is.</td>', 'Intriguing DOF - makes me wonder what the building I can see reflected is.', '2007-03-12 17:18:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(3454194, 482455, 5354, '<td valign="top">Looks to go out of focus in the top right corner. This sort of abstract needs to be technically faultless to work. Shame.</td>', 'Looks to go out of focus in the top right corner. This sort of abstract needs to be technically faultless to work. Shame.', '2007-03-12 17:20:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3454196, 482519, 30982, '<td valign="top">Very nicely done, from the oddly shaped shadows cast below the strainer to the slight bit of color in the reflection and the design that forms.  Nifty kitchen abstract art kinda thing.</td>', 'Very nicely done, from the oddly shaped shadows cast below the strainer to the slight bit of color in the reflection and the design that forms.  Nifty kitchen abstract art kinda thing.', '2007-03-12 17:21:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(3454200, 482683, 5354, '<td valign="top">Meets the challenge, but rather a dull subject. Strange glowing halos around each coins/disc probably from your post processing. Also strange shadow on wall (left).</td>', 'Meets the challenge, but rather a dull subject. Strange glowing halos around each coins/disc probably from your post processing. Also strange shadow on wall (left).', '2007-03-12 17:23:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3454201, 482705, 30982, '<td valign="top">I like the composition alot with the leading circles forming a leading line to the steps.  Just the right touches of green here and there, too, particularly on the stones.  Probably not scoring as high as you might like due to "technicals" but it''s a good picture.</td>', 'I like the composition alot with the leading circles forming a leading line to the steps.  Just the right touches of green here and there, too, particularly on the stones.  Probably not scoring as high as you might like due to "technicals" but it''s a good picture.', '2007-03-12 17:23:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3454203, 480725, 30982, '<td valign="top">I like the view in the center where you can just see these guys'' relatives, kinda.</td>', 'I like the view in the center where you can just see these guys'' relatives, kinda.', '2007-03-12 17:24:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(3454216, 481412, 33947, '<td valign="top">Love the composition and the diagonal line. The simplicity and conciseness is very nice. Sharp. 7</td>', 'Love the composition and the diagonal line. The simplicity and conciseness is very nice. Sharp. 7', '2007-03-12 17:28:20.000000', NULL, 1),
