(3456995, 482538, 60805, '<td valign="top">I love these images. Unfortunately your going to get some flak on this 1. Some people dont have properly calibrated monitors and will have a hard time seeing this. The scoring may be unfair because the DNMC police IMHO seem to be consistent at shooting 1st and asking questions later. But your in luck :) As my monitor is properly calibrated and i can see it clearly. The title hopefully will save u and give them a moment of pause. I wish u all the best on this one. It''s my 1st 10 so far.</td>', 'I love these images. Unfortunately your going to get some flak on this 1. Some people dont have properly calibrated monitors and will have a hard time seeing this. The scoring may be unfair because the DNMC police IMHO seem to be consistent at shooting 1st and asking questions later. But your in luck :) As my monitor is properly calibrated and i can see it clearly. The title hopefully will save u and give them a moment of pause. I wish u all the best on this one. It''s my 1st 10 so far.', '2007-03-13 16:48:58.000000', NULL, 1),
