(3457177, 480061, 3087, '<td valign="top">Cool! Love the shapes, that sense of all the lines converging in one place, the colours, the shallow DOF... all good.</td>', 'Cool! Love the shapes, that sense of all the lines converging in one place, the colours, the shallow DOF... all good.', '2007-03-13 18:21:10.000000', NULL, 1),
