(3457179, 481855, 3087, '<td valign="top">Woo! This is very cool. Lovely architectural shot - love the combination of the circular glass roof against the soaring straight lines of the building above as well as the irregular colours and shapes of that brooding sky. Fantastic lines and curves here. Excellent.</td>', 'Woo! This is very cool. Lovely architectural shot - love the combination of the circular glass roof against the soaring straight lines of the building above as well as the irregular colours and shapes of that brooding sky. Fantastic lines and curves here. Excellent.', '2007-03-13 18:22:09.000000', NULL, 1),
