(3462822, 482688, 18799, '<td valign="top">Good idea.  I think compositionally this could be better.  There is a lot of stuff that adds nothing to the image and should be cropped out.  I think the sides should be cropped way in, elimiating the ship on one side as that is just a distraction to the subject of your picture.  An equal about off the left side for balance.  Just the rock and maybe a hint of water on the sides would have been better for me.  Just one opinion, nothing more.  5</td>', 'Good idea.  I think compositionally this could be better.  There is a lot of stuff that adds nothing to the image and should be cropped out.  I think the sides should be cropped way in, elimiating the ship on one side as that is just a distraction to the subject of your picture.  An equal about off the left side for balance.  Just the rock and maybe a hint of water on the sides would have been better for me.  Just one opinion, nothing more.  5', '2007-03-14 23:53:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3462844, 481969, 18799, '<td valign="top">The colors are great, this has a calming feel to it. I kinda think there is too much going on here.  I think the closest circle should be in focus.  I think it also loses in competition with the Sydney Opera House in the background.</td>', 'The colors are great, this has a calming feel to it. I kinda think there is too much going on here.  I think the closest circle should be in focus.  I think it also loses in competition with the Sydney Opera House in the background.', '2007-03-14 23:58:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(3462854, 482810, 18799, '<td valign="top">Nice image if not a bit unnatural (not that it has to be).  I''m trying to figure this one out.  It''s too early in the water impact to create those rings and it wouldn''t do that anyway.  I hope you explain it when it''s all over.</td>', 'Nice image if not a bit unnatural (not that it has to be).  I''m trying to figure this one out.  It''s too early in the water impact to create those rings and it wouldn''t do that anyway.  I hope you explain it when it''s all over.', '2007-03-15 00:03:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3462863, 482216, 18799, '<td valign="top">I like this.  I think it would have been more dynamic if the subject wasn''t so centered.  I think I would have cropped more off the left - but that''s just one persons opinion.  8</td>', 'I like this.  I think it would have been more dynamic if the subject wasn''t so centered.  I think I would have cropped more off the left - but that''s just one persons opinion.  8', '2007-03-15 00:06:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3462864, 482755, 18799, '<td valign="top">Nice textures and symmetry.  7</td>', 'Nice textures and symmetry.  7', '2007-03-15 00:07:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3462874, 482789, 18799, '<td valign="top">Wow, pulling out all the stops with the waterdrops on the CD''s ;)  You''ve done a nice job here but the subject has become a bit cliche on this site.  Still, well executed, sharp and colorful. 7</td>', 'Wow, pulling out all the stops with the waterdrops on the CD''s ;)  You''ve done a nice job here but the subject has become a bit cliche on this site.  Still, well executed, sharp and colorful. 7', '2007-03-15 00:09:36.000000', NULL, 1),
