(3466681, 482853, 52500, '<td valign="top">Fantastic.  I love the point of view.  Good reminder to look up...who knows what you''ll find!</td>', 'Fantastic.  I love the point of view.  Good reminder to look up...who knows what you''ll find!', '2007-03-16 15:04:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(3466688, 482157, 68256, '<td valign="top">I did a simular photo, but I don''t want to give away too much information to try and change your vote....with that being said you did way better than me with the composition and lighting.  The boy looking up is great.  I love this low key photo and is a 10 for me.</td>', 'I did a simular photo, but I don''t want to give away too much information to try and change your vote....with that being said you did way better than me with the composition and lighting.  The boy looking up is great.  I love this low key photo and is a 10 for me.', '2007-03-16 15:09:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3466698, 480755, 52500, '<td valign="top">Damn that''s sharp!  Wonderful warm tones and composition.  Well done.</td>', 'Damn that''s sharp!  Wonderful warm tones and composition.  Well done.', '2007-03-16 15:14:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3466871, 481867, 41337, '<td valign="top">Good focus, color and clarity. Don''t care for the composition though.</td>', 'Good focus, color and clarity. Don''t care for the composition though.', '2007-03-16 16:22:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3466894, 481977, 41337, '<td valign="top">Meets the challenge very well and more. Ideally I would have like to see this closer up that a unique composition could have been utilized but I understand why you didn''t do it for this challenge. Good image.</td>', 'Meets the challenge very well and more. Ideally I would have like to see this closer up that a unique composition could have been utilized but I understand why you didn''t do it for this challenge. Good image.', '2007-03-16 16:29:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3466899, 482195, 41337, '<td valign="top">Good composition and the lighting helps make the circles stand out.</td>', 'Good composition and the lighting helps make the circles stand out.', '2007-03-16 16:30:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3466904, 481184, 41337, '<td valign="top">The flow of the coins within the frame is very pleasing as is the subtle lighting which help provide focal points for the eyes. The only thing I might do differently is play up the textures more by applying a more aggressive curves adjustment or dragonizer or something that enhances the textures more.</td>', 'The flow of the coins within the frame is very pleasing as is the subtle lighting which help provide focal points for the eyes. The only thing I might do differently is play up the textures more by applying a more aggressive curves adjustment or dragonizer or something that enhances the textures more.', '2007-03-16 16:33:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3466918, 481384, 41337, '<td valign="top">Very pretty image. A great example of being subtle yet still maintaining a strong connection to the challenge topic something a lot of these entries haven''t done.</td>', 'Very pretty image. A great example of being subtle yet still maintaining a strong connection to the challenge topic something a lot of these entries haven''t done.', '2007-03-16 16:38:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3466931, 482665, 41337, '<td valign="top">To be honest I think this is a bit of a stretch for the challenge. In my opinion, the image doesn''t convey what your title claims which frankly is just conjecture on your part. <br/> <br/>That said I don''t take off 60-70% just because I think something is DNMC so I still rated this based primarily on your photo''s merits which in general are ok but not exemplary. The lighting, color and composition do just enough to present the subject but nothing about them is taken to the next level if you know what I mean.</td>', 'To be honest I think this is a bit of a stretch for the challenge. In my opinion, the image doesn''t convey what your title claims which frankly is just conjecture on your part.  That said I don''t take off 60-70% just because I think something is DNMC so I still rated this based primarily on your photo''s merits which in general are ok but not exemplary. The lighting, color and composition do just enough to present the subject but nothing about them is taken to the next level if you know what I mean.', '2007-03-16 16:45:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3466943, 482634, 41337, '<td valign="top">Very fantasy like. I like the composition and the strong lighting. Would have liked to see the background a little more sharp and the details less muddy but I take it that''s because it''s a print or monitor screen? If so it might have been better to smooth it more with noise reduction to gain a little more clarity and make it less muddy. <br/> <br/>Btw, this critique is based on what I think would have improved your score not a critique on your art, that of which you should feel free to present in any way you see fit.</td>', 'Very fantasy like. I like the composition and the strong lighting. Would have liked to see the background a little more sharp and the details less muddy but I take it that''s because it''s a print or monitor screen? If so it might have been better to smooth it more with noise reduction to gain a little more clarity and make it less muddy.  Btw, this critique is based on what I think would have improved your score not a critique on your art, that of which you should feel free to present in any way you see fit.', '2007-03-16 16:49:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3466952, 482775, 41337, '<td valign="top">Your photographic technique is really good here. I am only a little puzzled about the message. I have an idea of what you may be trying to convey but feel like I am missing something important.</td>', 'Your photographic technique is really good here. I am only a little puzzled about the message. I have an idea of what you may be trying to convey but feel like I am missing something important.', '2007-03-16 16:52:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(3466959, 482765, 41337, '<td valign="top">Very unique POV. Everything works.</td>', 'Very unique POV. Everything works.', '2007-03-16 16:54:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3466963, 482822, 41337, '<td valign="top">Very artistic. Looks almost microscopic.</td>', 'Very artistic. Looks almost microscopic.', '2007-03-16 16:57:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3466967, 482209, 63503, '<td valign="top">How did you conceal the camera? great shot.</td>', 'How did you conceal the camera? great shot.', '2007-03-16 16:58:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(3466976, 482703, 41337, '<td valign="top">The one not cooperating makes the photo for me.</td>', 'The one not cooperating makes the photo for me.', '2007-03-16 17:00:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3466985, 482324, 41337, '<td valign="top">I don''t think I''ve seen straws look this pretty before.</td>', 'I don''t think I''ve seen straws look this pretty before.', '2007-03-16 17:03:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3466991, 481776, 41337, '<td valign="top">Not crazy about the title but the image is great.</td>', 'Not crazy about the title but the image is great.', '2007-03-16 17:04:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3466999, 482420, 41337, '<td valign="top">Nicely composed. For DPC I probably would have brighten this a little more.</td>', 'Nicely composed. For DPC I probably would have brighten this a little more.', '2007-03-16 17:06:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3467002, 482745, 41337, '<td valign="top">Unique POV and the editing is top notch.</td>', 'Unique POV and the editing is top notch.', '2007-03-16 17:07:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3467007, 481778, 41337, '<td valign="top">Lacks punch. Some more contrast and sharpening would help though.</td>', 'Lacks punch. Some more contrast and sharpening would help though.', '2007-03-16 17:08:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3467025, 482470, 41337, '<td valign="top">Pleasing image. I''m not sure if it''s your intent but it looks like they are floating in the air and the background is a print although I''m sure it''s not. Maybe a little more DOF would break that illusion?</td>', 'Pleasing image. I''m not sure if it''s your intent but it looks like they are floating in the air and the background is a print although I''m sure it''s not. Maybe a little more DOF would break that illusion?', '2007-03-16 17:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3467027, 482734, 41337, '<td valign="top">Very colorful. Domes do well so this should do well.</td>', 'Very colorful. Domes do well so this should do well.', '2007-03-16 17:14:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3467032, 482842, 63503, '<td valign="top">Great idea!!! good image too</td>', 'Great idea!!! good image too', '2007-03-16 17:16:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(3467047, 482472, 66952, '<td valign="top">I like the interesting angle and perspective on the car, and the colors and contrast are good. I don''t understand the signifigance of the people in the background. Are they the car owners? Are they meant to be in the shot, or were they just people standing around watching you.</td>', 'I like the interesting angle and perspective on the car, and the colors and contrast are good. I don''t understand the signifigance of the people in the background. Are they the car owners? Are they meant to be in the shot, or were they just people standing around watching you.', '2007-03-16 17:25:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3467170, 482838, 61651, '<td valign="top">With the simplicity of the subject and relative uniformity of color, this could have been a very boring shot, but I think the variety of circle sizes and asymmetry of the composition makes it effective.  Although I like it as it is, I wonder if it could be improved by having more "happening" on the far right side of the frame - maybe it could have benefited from a slight crop on the right side?</td>', 'With the simplicity of the subject and relative uniformity of color, this could have been a very boring shot, but I think the variety of circle sizes and asymmetry of the composition makes it effective.  Although I like it as it is, I wonder if it could be improved by having more "happening" on the far right side of the frame - maybe it could have benefited from a slight crop on the right side?', '2007-03-16 18:35:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3467176, 482726, 67301, '<td valign="top">A poor shot all round, Sorry</td>', 'A poor shot all round, Sorry', '2007-03-16 18:36:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(3467178, 480112, 60495, '<td valign="top">Great image really fits the challenge and nicely done. 10</td>', 'Great image really fits the challenge and nicely done. 10', '2007-03-16 18:37:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(3467198, 480015, 67301, '<td valign="top">over the top enhancement has done nothing for this shot. the idea is good as is the crop. Sorry</td>', 'over the top enhancement has done nothing for this shot. the idea is good as is the crop. Sorry', '2007-03-16 18:48:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3467199, 482450, 67301, '<td valign="top">This shot lacks definition, sorry</td>', 'This shot lacks definition, sorry', '2007-03-16 18:48:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3467200, 482256, 67301, '<td valign="top">If I could find somthing in this shot to be positive about I would. This of course may say more about me than the shot. Sorry</td>', 'If I could find somthing in this shot to be positive about I would. This of course may say more about me than the shot. Sorry', '2007-03-16 18:48:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3467201, 480353, 67301, '<td valign="top">This shot looks over exposed/enhanced. It has no meaning/expression. Sorry</td>', 'This shot looks over exposed/enhanced. It has no meaning/expression. Sorry', '2007-03-16 18:49:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3467228, 481234, 66952, '<td valign="top">Yep, that''s a circle all right. You''ll get voted down for the gun, but I think the shot is refreshing, original, and well done. I might have tried to get a little more contrast onto the muzzle of the gun, so it stands out more, but that''s a minor thing.</td>', 'Yep, that''s a circle all right. You''ll get voted down for the gun, but I think the shot is refreshing, original, and well done. I might have tried to get a little more contrast onto the muzzle of the gun, so it stands out more, but that''s a minor thing.', '2007-03-16 19:06:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3467258, 481980, 66384, '<td valign="top">Exquisite focus and DOF.</td>', 'Exquisite focus and DOF.', '2007-03-16 19:24:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3467267, 481834, 75599, '<td valign="top">The round bud stands out immediately. Nice!</td>', 'The round bud stands out immediately. Nice!', '2007-03-16 19:25:56.000000', NULL, 1),
