(3471455, 481826, 41337, '<td valign="top">Nice result!</td>', 'Nice result!', '2007-03-19 04:52:34.000000', NULL, 0),
(3471464, 482263, 47541, '<td valign="top">Greetings from the Critique Club!<br/> <br/>My first impressions on seeing this are that this is a very interesting and colourful shot.    It meets the challenge and the ring of eggs draws the eye around and around looking at the details.<br/> <br/>I''m a fan of negative space so the vast emptyness in the middle works for me but it won''t for everyone, as some commenters said.  The coloured border works too, which they often don''t.<br/> <br/>The lighting does seem a bit harsh, especially on the bottom-left of the circle.  The pastel colours are a good choice but DPC voters tend to like bright colours more.<br/> <br/>Overall, a good shot with something difference from the usual.  The score reflects that and if you had got the lighting a bit softer I think you''d have got closer to a 6.  <br/> <br/>Good luck in future challenges.  Fell free to PM me if you have any questions.</td>', 'Greetings from the Critique Club! My first impressions on seeing this are that this is a very interesting and colourful shot.    It meets the challenge and the ring of eggs draws the eye around and around looking at the details. I''m a fan of negative space so the vast emptyness in the middle works for me but it won''t for everyone, as some commenters said.  The coloured border works too, which they often don''t. The lighting does seem a bit harsh, especially on the bottom-left of the circle.  The pastel colours are a good choice but DPC voters tend to like bright colours more. Overall, a good shot with something difference from the usual.  The score reflects that and if you had got the lighting a bit softer I think you''d have got closer to a 6.   Good luck in future challenges.  Fell free to PM me if you have any questions.', '2007-03-19 05:18:53.000000', NULL, 0),
(3471466, 482798, 41337, '<td valign="top">Well I had this peg for much greater things. I thought for sure you had me beat.</td>', 'Well I had this peg for much greater things. I thought for sure you had me beat.', '2007-03-19 05:26:43.000000', NULL, 0),
(3471475, 482632, 65886, '<td valign="top">excellent idea indeed and I don''t see anything wrong with the pp. when I first saw it it looked like a fan inside a window and then I reilized it is not, and the title is perfect. very intriguing image!</td>', 'excellent idea indeed and I don''t see anything wrong with the pp. when I first saw it it looked like a fan inside a window and then I reilized it is not, and the title is perfect. very intriguing image!', '2007-03-19 05:38:17.000000', NULL, 0),
(3471477, 482195, 65886, '<td valign="top">excelent combination of shapes! these circles on the foreground and those high peaks behind, you chose a perfect angle and place to shoot from. and those clouds are also round:)</td>', 'excelent combination of shapes! these circles on the foreground and those high peaks behind, you chose a perfect angle and place to shoot from. and those clouds are also round:)', '2007-03-19 05:39:44.000000', NULL, 0),
(3471479, 482432, 65886, '<td valign="top">it made me smile, too! wonderful colors, and a great idea, should have scored much higher. and I really would like to have one of those:P they look so happy</td>', 'it made me smile, too! wonderful colors, and a great idea, should have scored much higher. and I really would like to have one of those:P they look so happy', '2007-03-19 05:42:17.000000', NULL, 0),
(3471481, 482758, 65886, '<td valign="top">what a beautiful idea! I agree with Jayson, the colors are exhellent, and the slight diagonal line of the flower makes the composition just perfect. what a light and dreamy and fragile feeling the photo gives!:)</td>', 'what a beautiful idea! I agree with Jayson, the colors are exhellent, and the slight diagonal line of the flower makes the composition just perfect. what a light and dreamy and fragile feeling the photo gives!:)', '2007-03-19 05:46:43.000000', NULL, 0),
(3471482, 481575, 65886, '<td valign="top">absolutely wonderful! I think this version is the most interesting one, it is so intriguing, makes me think and look at it longer and closer - and it is so nice! there is something weird and surreal about it in a natural way if you understand, not in a computer art way - just like I love it!:)</td>', 'absolutely wonderful! I think this version is the most interesting one, it is so intriguing, makes me think and look at it longer and closer - and it is so nice! there is something weird and surreal about it in a natural way if you understand, not in a computer art way - just like I love it!:)', '2007-03-19 05:49:33.000000', NULL, 0),
(3471485, 480724, 65886, '<td valign="top">interesting play of reflections and shadows! and it looks indeed like an eye, very intriguing!</td>', 'interesting play of reflections and shadows! and it looks indeed like an eye, very intriguing!', '2007-03-19 05:51:05.000000', NULL, 0),
