(3471619, 481679, 55838, '<td valign="top">R<br/>O<br/>B<br/>B<br/>E<br/>D<br/>!!!<br/>I cannont believe this did not score up near 7!  Fantastic shot.  Haunting eyes.  A wonderful capture to remind you of the compassion you feel for these people.  Obviously that beats any DPC number.  Hey, BTW, I''m going to Northern Thailand for my first overseas mission trip in July.  I sure hope I''m a kid magnet too.  Adding to favorites.</td>', 'ROBBED!!!I cannont believe this did not score up near 7!  Fantastic shot.  Haunting eyes.  A wonderful capture to remind you of the compassion you feel for these people.  Obviously that beats any DPC number.  Hey, BTW, I''m going to Northern Thailand for my first overseas mission trip in July.  I sure hope I''m a kid magnet too.  Adding to favorites.', '2007-03-19 07:18:26.000000', NULL, 0),
