(3472749, 481356, 67697, '<td valign="top">I like that you matched up some symbols there.  If you were going to try this again, I''d like to see them sitting on black, and maybe move the angle of lighting a bit.  Make it float!  Isn''t that what everything looks like it is doing any way after too much sake??? hehe</td>', 'I like that you matched up some symbols there.  If you were going to try this again, I''d like to see them sitting on black, and maybe move the angle of lighting a bit.  Make it float!  Isn''t that what everything looks like it is doing any way after too much sake??? hehe', '2007-03-19 13:27:28.000000', NULL, 0),
