(3473257, 482579, 66384, '<td valign="top">It''s hard to believe the commenters gave you 1s -- their comments seem so mild. But there''s no denying they did. I think there has to be something terribly bad about a shot for it to deserve a 1. It''s interesting to note that <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=173" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">akcoffeeguy</a> hasn''t entered a challenge since 2002 and he votes very low (aver. vote cast 4.2).<br/> <br/>I gave this a 6 because I like the bubbles. The focus and colors of the bubbles are excellent, and after all, the point of the challenge was circles.</td>', 'It''s hard to believe the commenters gave you 1s -- their comments seem so mild. But there''s no denying they did. I think there has to be something terribly bad about a shot for it to deserve a 1. It''s interesting to note that  akcoffeeguy hasn''t entered a challenge since 2002 and he votes very low (aver. vote cast 4.2). I gave this a 6 because I like the bubbles. The focus and colors of the bubbles are excellent, and after all, the point of the challenge was circles.', '2007-03-19 16:08:17.000000', NULL, 0),
