(3478517, 482726, 62318, '<td valign="top">Pretty cool picture, not sure what I am looking at exactly but a great capture. One thing you might try is a square format crop. Not sure but you  might like that format better as the center is the real focus. Still a great exposure and a photo that should have done much better in my opinion.</td>', 'Pretty cool picture, not sure what I am looking at exactly but a great capture. One thing you might try is a square format crop. Not sure but you  might like that format better as the center is the real focus. Still a great exposure and a photo that should have done much better in my opinion.', '2007-03-21 12:20:57.000000', NULL, 0),
