(3481146, 481980, 811, '<td valign="top">Bubble shots are hard.  You did awesome on this.  I agree, though, that a bit of brightness would have helped.  The background is kinda drab, but bubbles scream "bright and happy" so it sets up an interesting contrast.</td>', 'Bubble shots are hard.  You did awesome on this.  I agree, though, that a bit of brightness would have helped.  The background is kinda drab, but bubbles scream "bright and happy" so it sets up an interesting contrast.', '2007-03-22 11:40:22.000000', NULL, 0),
