(3481547, 481348, 47541, '<td valign="top">Greetings from the Critique Club<br/> <br/>You''ve tried to make what is a very dull subject interesting with the use of light.  This is good.  The shadows do add interest to the image.  Three is a good number of objects to include too!<br/> <br/>Composition: Not much to say except that it feels a little tight at the top.  Was this intentional?  Some comments on your photo may help with these critiques.<br/> <br/>Technical: The lighting is a bit harsh, especially in the reflections.  Again, I can''t tell if this is intentional as you have no comments on the image.<br/> <br/>Feel: It''s not the most exciting topic and you''ve somewhat added interest but the base topic just that interesting to get the score much higher.<br/> <br/>PM me if you have any questions.</td>', 'Greetings from the Critique Club You''ve tried to make what is a very dull subject interesting with the use of light.  This is good.  The shadows do add interest to the image.  Three is a good number of objects to include too! Composition: Not much to say except that it feels a little tight at the top.  Was this intentional?  Some comments on your photo may help with these critiques. Technical: The lighting is a bit harsh, especially in the reflections.  Again, I can''t tell if this is intentional as you have no comments on the image. Feel: It''s not the most exciting topic and you''ve somewhat added interest but the base topic just that interesting to get the score much higher. PM me if you have any questions.', '2007-03-22 14:35:13.000000', NULL, 0),
(3482235, 481909, 57886, '<td valign="top">Falleg þessi. Við Arngrímur (minn elsti) tókum nokkrar af giftingarhringunum okkar fyrir þessa keppni eeeen ég sendi enga inn :o) Þessi er flott... við vorum með vatn í okkar tilraunum og vorum öll orðin rennandi blaut híhí...<br/> <br/>Nice picture Sigrún, like the blur on one of the rings and the choice of background to bring out the color of the gold - nice.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2007-03-22 19:43:27.</i></td>', 'Falleg þessi. Við Arngrímur (minn elsti) tókum nokkrar af giftingarhringunum okkar fyrir þessa keppni eeeen ég sendi enga inn :o) Þessi er flott... við vorum með vatn í okkar tilraunum og vorum öll orðin rennandi blaut híhí... Nice picture Sigrún, like the blur on one of the rings and the choice of background to bring out the color of the gold - nice.', '2007-03-22 19:42:20.000000', '2007-03-22 19:43:27.000000', 0),
