(4323940, 480027, 63269, '<td valign="top">Awesome idea! The only thing I don''t like is the tiny red and blue splotches... which somehow make it almost look like a 3-D picture without the glasses. Perhaps it might look better in black and white. Then again, I don''t know, maybe you intended to get that effect... just a thought. :)</td>', 'Awesome idea! The only thing I don''t like is the tiny red and blue splotches... which somehow make it almost look like a 3-D picture without the glasses. Perhaps it might look better in black and white. Then again, I don''t know, maybe you intended to get that effect... just a thought. :)', '2007-12-19 16:32:50.000000', NULL, 0),
